  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#8734;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#8734;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Case I: <math><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />LHS is non negative, RHS is negative<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>&nbsp;the inequality is always true</p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo></math><br />Case II: <math><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Taking the union of the two cases, we get,&nbsp;<br /><math><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#8734;</mi><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
  }
